I find myself kicking down doors a lot in certain situations.  I'm not
a devout door-kicker, I do prefer keying the door if possible.
However, cases do arise...

1. I am keyless.  This matters the most a lower levels, where I tend
to scour every room I find.  Later, I usually have a key, but will
also teleport around locked-up levels.

2. I need to move diagonally through the door area, to avoid
something.  Usually this is a trap, but it could also be a water tile
or something.  It varies.  Regardless, closing the door and kicking it
down allows you to pass through the doorway diagonally, and this is
the most common reason for me needing to kick down doors.

